#HTML(
<table>
  <tr><th>#R$C4C7</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>YOU ARE AT THE WEST END OF THE CAVERN OF CRACKS. A SMALL STONE BRIDGE SPANS A DEEP CREVASSE TO THE EAST. A WOODEN PLANK ALSO SPANS THE CREVASSE. EXIT W.</td>
