</table>
)

[Location:cavern-of-cracks:Cavern of Cracks]
#HTML(
<table>
  <tr><th>#R$C575</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>YOU ARE IN A LONG DUSTY CAVERN OF CRACKS. A DEEP CREVASSE RUNS ACROSS THE CENTRE OF THE CAVERN AND IS SPANNED BY A SMALL STONE BRIDGE. A 25FT PLANK ALSO SPANS THE CREVASSE. EXIT E.</td>
  </tr>
</table>
)

[Location:slime-cavern:Slime Cavern]
#HTML(
